<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 66.5.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 66.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 366,000 shares in Computerland SA at 66.5 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Computerland was trading at 74.5 zlotys in 3,486 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
